- **Item:** T227 — Substitution-at-action: the halving that reveals flesh · queue #102 · FIRST ATTEMPT · Packet #13 (PES "Fresh Guacamole", YouTube dNJdJIwCF_Y, 100.894 s), packet-local T04.
