workspace/jobs/sync-staging/study/style-library/techniques-transitions.md:333:- Mechanics: a green golf ball rolls onto the board (dimples reading as lime peel); halved, its cut face is a lime's cross-section; one half goes into a metal citrus press and is squeezed over the bowl. Two reveals chained — the halving proves the casting, the pressing spends it. (Episode form rides T227's substitution-at-action mechanism — not owed separately.)
workspace/jobs/sync-staging/study/style-library/techniques-transitions.md:338:- Mechanics: the opened bulb's filament assembly is picked out with the pepper de-seeding gesture; chopping follows and the pieces accumulate as a neat pile of green Monopoly houses. The landing identity is assigned by the action's product-shape. (Rides T232's literalization mechanism — not owed separately.)
